{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overrust is a 2D post-apocalyptic survival game with a horror atmosphere and cyberpunk aesthetic. The player takes on the role of a survivor who must explore decaying environments, avoid deadly enemies, and solve environmental puzzles to progress. Every resource found and every strategic decision at the right moment can be the difference between living and being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruins and hostile environments full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve dynamic puzzles that utilize the environment and the player's logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth as your main weapon against relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically utilize the few resources available.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4150100?t=1770141983","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4150100?t=1770141983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150100/c9ea303d8f52542e5ca83bf5a64d366134a602ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770141983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150100/c9ea303d8f52542e5ca83bf5a64d366134a602ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770141983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"